---
description: Prevent duplicate nodes when instancing reusable Godot scenes
globs: "**/*.tscn"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Nested scene instances

- In a parent scene, serialize only the `PackedScene` instance root and its property overrides.
- Never assign the parent scene as `owner` of descendants already supplied by the nested scene.
- Never copy child node blocks under an instance path; edit the source scene instead.
- Put parent-specific additions under a separate wrapper/sibling node.
- After saving, reopen the parent scene and treat every `incoming node's name clashes` warning as a failed change.
